
# Secrets — never commit .LOCAL env files with REAL secrets.
# DEPLOY-GATE (2026-06-19): Emergent's deploy pipeline rewrites and
# consumes .env, backend/.env, and frontend/.env at deploy time, so
# those three files MUST remain visible to the repo state.  Only
# per-developer `.local` overrides are ignored.
frontend/.env.local
.env.local
.env.*.local
# allow .env, backend/.env, frontend/.env, .env.example, .env.schema,
# .env.deploy etc.

# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

